    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say \"it gets better\" or \"stay strong\" but it doesn't feel like that. it feels like i'm just waiting for a clock to run out. the world is so broken and corrupt and there's no place for someone like me in it. honestly, it feels like the most logical thing is to just... stop. to just stop fighting a battle that was lost before i even started. it feels like the only way to actually find peace is to just not be here anymore.",
